{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["<b>Or when he hears a voice of adjuration.</b> Come and see: in all the parashiyyot it writes שגגה, but here and in the case of an oath of utterance it does not write שגגה — to tell you that the punishment for an oath is so great that even its inadvertence ascends to deliberateness. And so Solomon said: ״אל תתן את פיך לחטיא את בשרך ואל תאמר לפני המלאך כי שגגה היא״. And furthermore, when the Holy One, blessed be He, comes to judge humanity, He will judge them together with sorcerers and adulterers, as it is said: ״והייתי עד ממהר במכשפים ובמנאפים ובנשבעים בשמי לשקר״."], :book :leviticus, :voice :daat-zkenim, :lang :en, :chapter 5, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T13:08:33.702203239Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}